{"title": "重复 return：第一条生效且不报错", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "location /dup {"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "    return 200 \"first\";"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "    return 200 \"second\";   # 静默忽略"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "}"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "nginx -s reload"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost/dup"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "first"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "reload 无任何警告：第二条被静默丢弃"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
